{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "4101d092-f260-8b62-84d7-7b55874933cc",
  "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:11:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Teresa Raposo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:09:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:09:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, hello. I'm sorry to bother you. I'm not sure if I have the right department. I'm calling for my mother, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:09:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, you're okay. Tell me what's going on and we'll see where it belongs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:09:21-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So there's a fence, the one along the edge of the park near my mother's house, on Carroll Avenue. It's three forty-one. And part of it is knocked down, or bent over, I guess, from the wind this morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:09:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And when you say the park, is the fence on the park side, so it's the city's fence? Or is it the property line of your mother's yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:09:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. Um, I think it's the park's. It's [line breaks up] the edge of the park, not her yard. Is that, is that a different thing? Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is a little different. You broke up there, can you say that again?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:09:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said it's on the park side. Not my mother's. I just wanted to report it so somebody knows. Who would I talk to about that? Am I doing this right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing fine. A city park fence usually isn't us, that would be more the Public Services side, parks and grounds. I can transfer you, or take down the details and pass it along. Which would you rather?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, could you transfer me? Or, wait, if it drops, would I have to call back? I'm in a bad spot for signal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me do both. Give me your number first, in case it drops."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, it's four zero one, five five five, zero one seven nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one seven nine, got it. And that's Teresa?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Teresa Raposo. R-A-P-O-S-O. Sorry, is that too much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all. I'll note the fence at the park edge by three forty-one Carroll, damaged in today's storm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Um, can I ask something kind of silly? Are you working through the holidays too? I wasn't sure if somebody would even be there to call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:10:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not silly. The office has some closed days, but I'll be here most of the time. Someone will get back to you either way."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:11:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. [inaudible] so I wait for the call, or the transfer? I'm sorry, I'm a little mixed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:11:13-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Stay on, I'm transferring you now. If it drops, they have your number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:11:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you so much."
    }
  ],
